window.KINESICA_GOOGLE_REVIEWS={placeId:"ChIJZ2mPW9K1vJUR3J5kGRi5gws",fetchedAt:"2026-09-01T23:09:37.616Z",displayName:"Kinesica",googleMapsUri:"https://maps.google.com/?cid=829710269522681564&g_mp=CiVnb29nbGUubWFwcy5wbGFjZXMudjEuUGxhY2VzLkdldFBsYWNlEAIYBCAA",rating:5,userRatingCount:31,reviews:[{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Hace a\xF1os que concurro, la atenci\xF3n de Norberto es excelente. Sabe escuchar para poder determinar sobre que puntos focalizar el trabajo y conoce diversas t\xE9cnicas que utiliza seg\xFAn la necesidad del paciente. Siempre sal\xED de la consulta sinti\xE9ndome mejor que al inicio. Lo recomiendo much\xEDsimo!!!!!",language:"es"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incre\xEDblemente sorprendido para bien, llevo 3 a\xF1os con un dolor por epicondilitis, en apenas 2 sesiones con el kinesiologo Norberto Brude no tengo dolor, pude volver a entrenar, me despertaba con la mano dormida, no me volvi\xF3 a suceder! Sinceramente un profesional fuera de serie, y sobre todo supo llevar calma cuando m\xE1s lo necesitaba.",language:"es"},{author:"Claudia Rothschild",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7zjR9a6k2KK0-ciZ60piNXJdtemgzlxd8EAGV2FdBnpfcV7wcWA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118351524349714047042/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto Brude es excelente. Por  varios problemas en la columna, rodilla, cuello que me producen permanentes dolores  hace a\xF1os que hice varios intentos con otros profesionales pero reci\xE9n con su tratamiento siento un considerable alivio- Lo recomiendo!!!",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 1 mes",publishTime:"2026-07-21T22:41:19.944949311Z"},{author:"Susana M\xFChlmann",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWUfGXN593tTwuhxuqVKOEWUIvavQjTlY93VeBQWBCQXFlW3nY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107592515738110590238/reviews",rating:5,text:"La consulta con el Klgo. Norberto Brude fue excelente. Me atiende desde hace m\xE1s de treinta a\xF1os, conoce mi cuerpo y temas de salud de importancia, y trabaja en funci\xF3n de lo que necesito y puedo hacer. C\xF3mo se me dificulta ir al consultorio, vino a mi casa y, despu\xE9s de tener un cuadro de situaci\xF3n, me dej\xF3 ejercicios que primero practicamos, para hacer sola, orientados a un fortalecimiento que elimine dolores y mejore mi calidad de vida integralmente. De igual manera, respond\xED\xF3 con premura a nuevos dolores que le inform\xE9 posteriormente, para ver c\xF3mo proseguir. Adem\xE1s de un excelente profesional, es una gran persona. Altamente recomendable.",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 5 meses",publishTime:"2026-03-27T19:20:10.553212148Z"},{author:"Martin Figueroa",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWH1NIssF8Mao5RzMLHufdWDcctM9XzC6a9okzyyojbh9m-22pw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114835887772282675184/reviews",rating:5,text:"Excelente atenci\xF3n del doctor Brude en cada sesi\xF3n. Explica con claridad y genera mucha confianza. Se nota el compromiso con la recuperaci\xF3n del paciente. Su trato es muy amable y personalizado.",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 5 meses",publishTime:"2026-03-18T19:26:52.862442188Z"}],byLang:{es:[{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Hace a\xF1os que concurro, la atenci\xF3n de Norberto es excelente. Sabe escuchar para poder determinar sobre que puntos focalizar el trabajo y conoce diversas t\xE9cnicas que utiliza seg\xFAn la necesidad del paciente. Siempre sal\xED de la consulta sinti\xE9ndome mejor que al inicio. Lo recomiendo much\xEDsimo!!!!!",language:"es"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incre\xEDblemente sorprendido para bien, llevo 3 a\xF1os con un dolor por epicondilitis, en apenas 2 sesiones con el kinesiologo Norberto Brude no tengo dolor, pude volver a entrenar, me despertaba con la mano dormida, no me volvi\xF3 a suceder! Sinceramente un profesional fuera de serie, y sobre todo supo llevar calma cuando m\xE1s lo necesitaba.",language:"es"},{author:"Claudia Rothschild",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7zjR9a6k2KK0-ciZ60piNXJdtemgzlxd8EAGV2FdBnpfcV7wcWA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118351524349714047042/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto Brude es excelente. Por  varios problemas en la columna, rodilla, cuello que me producen permanentes dolores  hace a\xF1os que hice varios intentos con otros profesionales pero reci\xE9n con su tratamiento siento un considerable alivio- Lo recomiendo!!!",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 1 mes",publishTime:"2026-07-21T22:41:19.944949311Z"},{author:"Susana M\xFChlmann",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWUfGXN593tTwuhxuqVKOEWUIvavQjTlY93VeBQWBCQXFlW3nY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107592515738110590238/reviews",rating:5,text:"La consulta con el Klgo. Norberto Brude fue excelente. Me atiende desde hace m\xE1s de treinta a\xF1os, conoce mi cuerpo y temas de salud de importancia, y trabaja en funci\xF3n de lo que necesito y puedo hacer. C\xF3mo se me dificulta ir al consultorio, vino a mi casa y, despu\xE9s de tener un cuadro de situaci\xF3n, me dej\xF3 ejercicios que primero practicamos, para hacer sola, orientados a un fortalecimiento que elimine dolores y mejore mi calidad de vida integralmente. De igual manera, respond\xED\xF3 con premura a nuevos dolores que le inform\xE9 posteriormente, para ver c\xF3mo proseguir. Adem\xE1s de un excelente profesional, es una gran persona. Altamente recomendable.",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 5 meses",publishTime:"2026-03-27T19:20:10.553212148Z"},{author:"Martin Figueroa",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWH1NIssF8Mao5RzMLHufdWDcctM9XzC6a9okzyyojbh9m-22pw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114835887772282675184/reviews",rating:5,text:"Excelente atenci\xF3n del doctor Brude en cada sesi\xF3n. Explica con claridad y genera mucha confianza. Se nota el compromiso con la recuperaci\xF3n del paciente. Su trato es muy amable y personalizado.",language:"es",relativeTime:"Hace 5 meses",publishTime:"2026-03-18T19:26:52.862442188Z"}],en:[{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"I've been coming here for years, and Norberto's care is excellent. He knows how to listen so he can decide where to focus the work, and he uses a range of techniques according to the patient's needs. I always left feeling better than when I arrived. I recommend him highly!!!!!",language:"en"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incredibly surprised, in a good way: I had epicondylitis pain for 3 years, and after just 2 sessions with kinesiologist Norberto Brude I have no pain, I was able to go back to training, I used to wake up with a numb hand and it hasn't happened again! Truly an outstanding professional, and above all he brought calm when I needed it most.",language:"en"},{author:"Claudia Rothschild",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7zjR9a6k2KK0-ciZ60piNXJdtemgzlxd8EAGV2FdBnpfcV7wcWA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118351524349714047042/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto Brude is excellent. I've had several problems with my spine, knees, and neck that have caused me constant pain for years. I tried several other professionals, but only with his treatment have I felt considerable relief. I highly recommend him!",language:"en",relativeTime:"a month ago",publishTime:"2026-07-21T22:41:19.944949311Z"},{author:"Susana M\xFChlmann",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWUfGXN593tTwuhxuqVKOEWUIvavQjTlY93VeBQWBCQXFlW3nY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107592515738110590238/reviews",rating:5,text:"My consultation with physiotherapist Norberto Brude was excellent. He has been treating me for over thirty years, knows my body and important health issues, and works according to my needs and abilities. Since it's difficult for me to go to the office, he came to my house and, after assessing my situation, gave me exercises to do on my own. These exercises, which we initially practiced together, were designed to strengthen my muscles, eliminate pain, and improve my overall quality of life. He also responded promptly to any new pains I reported later, to discuss how to proceed. In addition to being an excellent professional, he is a wonderful person. Highly recommended.",language:"en",relativeTime:"5 months ago",publishTime:"2026-03-27T19:20:10.553212148Z"},{author:"Jack Grantham",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWSSbjYSLBV4mxom-l1D8K58_Mnko-xAxdA_PJ6irzmVMwrBTQvzg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/116757338678492155627/reviews",rating:5,text:`Amazing person! He is a healer.
Thank you very much.`,language:"en",relativeTime:"a year ago",publishTime:"2025-01-21T04:07:42.347641Z"}],fr:[{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Je viens le consulter depuis des ann\xE9es, et l'accompagnement de Norberto est excellent. Il sait \xE9couter pour d\xE9terminer sur quels points concentrer le travail, et il ma\xEEtrise diverses techniques qu'il utilise selon les besoins du patient. Je suis toujours sortie de la s\xE9ance mieux qu'\xE0 l'arriv\xE9e. Je le recommande vivement !!!!!",language:"fr"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Agr\xE9ablement surpris, au-del\xE0 de toute attente : je souffrais d'une \xE9picondylite depuis 3 ans, et en \xE0 peine 2 s\xE9ances avec le kin\xE9sith\xE9rapeute Norberto Brude je n'ai plus de douleur, j'ai pu reprendre l'entra\xEEnement, je me r\xE9veillais avec la main endormie et cela ne s'est plus reproduit ! Un professionnel hors pair, et surtout il a su m'apporter du calme quand j'en avais le plus besoin.",language:"fr"},{author:"Claudia Rothschild",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7zjR9a6k2KK0-ciZ60piNXJdtemgzlxd8EAGV2FdBnpfcV7wcWA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118351524349714047042/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto Brude est excellent. Je souffre de probl\xE8mes de dos, de genoux et de cou qui me causent des douleurs constantes depuis des ann\xE9es. J'ai consult\xE9 plusieurs autres praticiens, mais seul son traitement m'a apport\xE9 un soulagement consid\xE9rable. Je le recommande vivement\xA0!",language:"fr",relativeTime:"il y a un mois",publishTime:"2026-07-21T22:41:19.944949311Z"},{author:"Susana M\xFChlmann",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWUfGXN593tTwuhxuqVKOEWUIvavQjTlY93VeBQWBCQXFlW3nY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107592515738110590238/reviews",rating:5,text:"Ma consultation avec le physioth\xE9rapeute Norberto Brude a \xE9t\xE9 excellente. Il me suit depuis plus de trente ans, conna\xEEt parfaitement mon corps et mes principaux probl\xE8mes de sant\xE9, et adapte son travail \xE0 mes besoins et \xE0 mes capacit\xE9s. Comme il m'est difficile de me d\xE9placer \xE0 son cabinet, il est venu \xE0 mon domicile et, apr\xE8s avoir \xE9valu\xE9 ma situation, m'a donn\xE9 des exercices \xE0 faire chez moi. Ces exercices, que nous avons d'abord pratiqu\xE9s ensemble, visaient \xE0 renforcer mes muscles, \xE0 soulager mes douleurs et \xE0 am\xE9liorer ma qualit\xE9 de vie. Il a \xE9galement r\xE9pondu rapidement \xE0 toutes les nouvelles douleurs que j'ai signal\xE9es par la suite, afin de discuter de la marche \xE0 suivre. En plus d'\xEAtre un excellent professionnel, c'est une personne formidable. Je le recommande vivement.",language:"fr",relativeTime:"il y a 5\xA0mois",publishTime:"2026-03-27T19:20:10.553212148Z"},{author:"Martin Figueroa",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWH1NIssF8Mao5RzMLHufdWDcctM9XzC6a9okzyyojbh9m-22pw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114835887772282675184/reviews",rating:5,text:"Le Dr Brude prodigue d'excellents soins \xE0 chaque s\xE9ance. Ses explications sont claires et il inspire confiance. Son engagement envers le r\xE9tablissement du patient est manifeste. Son approche est empreinte de bienveillance et personnalis\xE9e.",language:"fr",relativeTime:"il y a 5\xA0mois",publishTime:"2026-03-18T19:26:52.862442188Z"}],pt:[{author:"Mariana Gonz\xE1lez Cadah\xEDa",authorPhoto:null,authorProfile:null,rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-29T22:10:00.000Z",text:"Venho h\xE1 anos, e o atendimento do Norberto \xE9 excelente. Ele sabe escutar para definir em que pontos focar o trabalho e conhece diversas t\xE9cnicas que usa conforme a necessidade do paciente. Sempre sa\xED da consulta me sentindo melhor do que no in\xEDcio. Recomendo muit\xEDssimo!!!!!",language:"pt"},{author:"Gabriel Rotman",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjU1sZgbUvf5_hu4GC95IP3lszyj_ugBsPntmjHporpoV7pMUC2sNg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba12",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/111063243092495440410/reviews",rating:5,publishTime:"2026-07-24T02:05:02.000Z",text:"Incrivelmente surpreso, para melhor: levei 3 anos com dor por epicondilite e, em apenas 2 sess\xF5es com o fisioterapeuta Norberto Brude, n\xE3o tenho mais dor, pude voltar a treinar, acordava com a m\xE3o dormente e isso n\xE3o voltou a acontecer! Sinceramente um profissional fora de s\xE9rie, e acima de tudo soube trazer calma quando mais eu precisava.",language:"pt"},{author:"Claudia Rothschild",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjV7zjR9a6k2KK0-ciZ60piNXJdtemgzlxd8EAGV2FdBnpfcV7wcWA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118351524349714047042/reviews",rating:5,text:"Norberto Brude \xE9 excelente. Sofri com diversos problemas na coluna, joelhos e pesco\xE7o que me causaram dores constantes por anos. Consultei v\xE1rios outros profissionais, mas somente com o tratamento dele senti um al\xEDvio consider\xE1vel. Recomendo-o fortemente!",language:"pt",relativeTime:"h\xE1 um m\xEAs",publishTime:"2026-07-21T22:41:19.944949311Z"},{author:"Susana M\xFChlmann",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWUfGXN593tTwuhxuqVKOEWUIvavQjTlY93VeBQWBCQXFlW3nY=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/107592515738110590238/reviews",rating:5,text:"Minha consulta com o fisioterapeuta Norberto Brude foi excelente. Ele me trata h\xE1 mais de trinta anos, conhece meu corpo e meus problemas de sa\xFAde, e trabalha de acordo com minhas necessidades e capacidades. Como tenho dificuldade para ir ao consult\xF3rio, ele veio at\xE9 minha casa e, ap\xF3s avaliar minha situa\xE7\xE3o, me passou exerc\xEDcios para fazer sozinha. Esses exerc\xEDcios, que praticamos juntos inicialmente, foram elaborados para fortalecer meus m\xFAsculos, eliminar a dor e melhorar minha qualidade de vida em geral. Ele tamb\xE9m respondeu prontamente a qualquer nova dor que relatei posteriormente, para discutir como proceder. Al\xE9m de ser um excelente profissional, ele \xE9 uma pessoa maravilhosa. Recomendo muito.",language:"pt",relativeTime:"h\xE1 5 meses",publishTime:"2026-03-27T19:20:10.553212148Z"},{author:"Martin Figueroa",authorPhoto:"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWH1NIssF8Mao5RzMLHufdWDcctM9XzC6a9okzyyojbh9m-22pw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",authorProfile:"https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114835887772282675184/reviews",rating:5,text:"O Dr. Brude oferece um atendimento excelente em todas as sess\xF5es. Ele explica tudo com clareza e inspira muita confian\xE7a. Seu comprometimento com a recupera\xE7\xE3o do paciente \xE9 evidente. Sua abordagem \xE9 muito gentil e personalizada.",language:"pt",relativeTime:"h\xE1 5 meses",publishTime:"2026-03-18T19:26:52.862442188Z"}]},translations:{"mariana gonzalez cadahia":{es:"Hace a\xF1os que concurro, la atenci\xF3n de Norberto es excelente. Sabe escuchar para poder determinar sobre que puntos focalizar el trabajo y conoce diversas t\xE9cnicas que utiliza seg\xFAn la necesidad del paciente. Siempre sal\xED de la consulta sinti\xE9ndome mejor que al inicio. Lo recomiendo much\xEDsimo!!!!!",en:"I've been coming here for years, and Norberto's care is excellent. He knows how to listen so he can decide where to focus the work, and he uses a range of techniques according to the patient's needs. I always left feeling better than when I arrived. I recommend him highly!!!!!",fr:"Je viens le consulter depuis des ann\xE9es, et l'accompagnement de Norberto est excellent. Il sait \xE9couter pour d\xE9terminer sur quels points concentrer le travail, et il ma\xEEtrise diverses techniques qu'il utilise selon les besoins du patient. Je suis toujours sortie de la s\xE9ance mieux qu'\xE0 l'arriv\xE9e. Je le recommande vivement !!!!!",pt:"Venho h\xE1 anos, e o atendimento do Norberto \xE9 excelente. Ele sabe escutar para definir em que pontos focar o trabalho e conhece diversas t\xE9cnicas que usa conforme a necessidade do paciente. Sempre sa\xED da consulta me sentindo melhor do que no in\xEDcio. Recomendo muit\xEDssimo!!!!!"},"gabriel rotman":{es:"Incre\xEDblemente sorprendido para bien, llevo 3 a\xF1os con un dolor por epicondilitis, en apenas 2 sesiones con el kinesiologo Norberto Brude no tengo dolor, pude volver a entrenar, me despertaba con la mano dormida, no me volvi\xF3 a suceder! Sinceramente un profesional fuera de serie, y sobre todo supo llevar calma cuando m\xE1s lo necesitaba.",en:"Incredibly surprised, in a good way: I had epicondylitis pain for 3 years, and after just 2 sessions with kinesiologist Norberto Brude I have no pain, I was able to go back to training, I used to wake up with a numb hand and it hasn't happened again! Truly an outstanding professional, and above all he brought calm when I needed it most.",fr:"Agr\xE9ablement surpris, au-del\xE0 de toute attente : je souffrais d'une \xE9picondylite depuis 3 ans, et en \xE0 peine 2 s\xE9ances avec le kin\xE9sith\xE9rapeute Norberto Brude je n'ai plus de douleur, j'ai pu reprendre l'entra\xEEnement, je me r\xE9veillais avec la main endormie et cela ne s'est plus reproduit ! Un professionnel hors pair, et surtout il a su m'apporter du calme quand j'en avais le plus besoin.",pt:"Incrivelmente surpreso, para melhor: levei 3 anos com dor por epicondilite e, em apenas 2 sess\xF5es com o fisioterapeuta Norberto Brude, n\xE3o tenho mais dor, pude voltar a treinar, acordava com a m\xE3o dormente e isso n\xE3o voltou a acontecer! Sinceramente um profissional fora de s\xE9rie, e acima de tudo soube trazer calma quando mais eu precisava."}}};
